"entity": {
"name": "TETRA Technologies, Inc.",
"description": "TETRA Technologies, Inc. is an energy services and solutions company, which focuses on developing environmentally conscious services and solutions that help make people\u2019s lives better. It operates through the Completion Fluids and Products Division, and Water and Flowback Services Division segments. The Completion Fluids and Products Division segment manufactures and markets clear brine fluids, additives, and associated products and services to the oil and gas industry. The Water and Flowback Services Division segment offers onshore oil and gas operators with comprehensive water management services. The company was founded in 1981 and is headquartered in Spring, TX.",
